WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Start with a clear plan. Turn what is on your mind into a reviewable day.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.100
Start in My Day. Your focus and plan sit on the dashboard.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.600
Choose Plan your day. Describe the work in your own words.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.000
Review the draft. Edit the commitments before you confirm anything.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.200
A plan you can review. Nothing is filed until you confirm the plan.
